# benilla's own interface, one layer on the stock one (docs/METHOD.md): every file is ours, from
# `assets/ui`, and loads in this order after every `benilla.toc` row and before the third-party
# addons. It is listed in no addon list, fires no `ADDON_LOADED` and cannot be switched off; a dev
# build boots without it under `WOW_STOCK_UI=1`. A test names its files, so it does not grow.

## Interface: 11200

# The scroll parts of our options window and script log.
ScrollTemplates.xml
# The Keybindings page's templates and script, which OptionsFrame.xml uses at load.
KeyBindingsPage.xml
# `BenillaOptionsFrame`; its rows read the option globals the stock options windows set.
OptionsFrame.xml
# The ESC menu's era look on the stock `GameMenuFrame`, whose Options rung opens ours.
GameMenuAdapters.xml
# Wraps the stock bag verbs; the keyring is a container (id -2).
ContainerFrameAdapters.xml
# The pet page's autocast widgets in the pet action button's proportions.
SpellBookAdapters.xml
# The `/errors` script error log and our slash commands.
ScriptLogFrame.xml
# Our fixes to the stock Lua.
FrameXMLFixes.xml
